[] I just got Nethack PL8, and no sooner than I started playing, I saw that
[] PL9 is out.  Would somebody please post a brief note explaining what bugs
[] are being fixed and what features are being added/deleted in the new
[] version? I would like to know if it is worth downloading.

allow me (not official but it should suffice) ...

no {significant} new features in pl8 or pl9.

pl8 had the most impact in fixing various bugs (i.e. kicking, zapping,
looting bugs, etc.) and smoothed over various other irritations and
further extended the porting efforts (consistency and integrity, etc.).

pl9 covered a few "minor" bugs, some reported at the time of the release
of pl8.  the game seems to have stablized since no new bug reports
have surfaced in awhile.  the world is now safe for Kop Kaptains
that happen to be robbing Magic Memory Vaults ...

comp.sources.games will soon release a fully patched version of the
game, thanx Bill!  that should help some.  everyone should upgrade
to pl9 since it is most likely the stablest (and funnest) version of
3.0 to date!  unless something _fatal_ shows up, that should be it.

